---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import {volumes,volumeTitle} from '../../lib/catalog';
const groups=[{name:'魏书',label:'卷 01—30',items:volumes.slice(0,30)},{name:'蜀书',label:'卷 31—45',items:volumes.slice(30,45)},{name:'吴书',label:'卷 46—65',items:volumes.slice(45,65)},{name:'附录',label:'裴松之',items:volumes.slice(65)}];
---
<Base title="全书目录" active="read"><div class="shell browse-page"><div class="page-heading"><div class="eyebrow">原文 / SOURCES</div><h1>回到原文，<br/><em>听见不同的声音。</em></h1><p>陈寿正文与裴松之注，按原书阅读顺序保留。<br/>65 卷及《上三国志注表》，从感兴趣的一卷开始。</p></div>{groups.map(g=><section class="toc-section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>{g.name}</h2><span class="muted">{g.label}</span></div><div class="toc-grid">{g.items.map(v=><a href={`/read/${v.id}/`}><span>{v.id==='appendix'?'附':v.id.slice(1)}</span><strong>{volumeTitle(v)}</strong><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></a>)}</div></section>)}<p class="browse-footnote">网络录入本，未逐字校勘。页面标题作简体导航展示，阅读区保留原文。<a href="/about/">查看版本与整理说明 ↗</a></p></div></Base>
